></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mini-Games</strong><br>You can trigger some very interesting scenes by interacting with certain objects!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, you\u2019ll need to play a console game or connect electrical wires to progress through the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/f2aa47121b6ae91e556468b88a8b44f9.poster.avif?t=1755646485\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/f2aa47121b6ae91e556468b88a8b44f9.webm?t=1755646485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/f2aa47121b6ae91e556468b88a8b44f9.mp4?t=1755646485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And that's not all\u2014many more surprise mini-games are waiting for you throughout the narrative!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/abf927750f9a53eee77461ad94190cfd.poster.avif?t=1755646485\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/abf927750f9a53eee77461ad94190cfd.webm?t=1755646485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/abf927750f9a53eee77461ad94190cfd.mp4?t=1755646485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A dramatic and surprising story...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Chris searches for his son Cedric, the past and future will intertwine in unexpected ways, leading to emotional and heartfelt moments throughout the journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/194e04a56f0d050c86196e4b5ec081d3.avif?t=1755646485\" width=616 height=300 /></span><strong>Message from the game developer:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character cards, the option to play in 11 languages, mazes, puzzles, and many more features I can't even begin to describe are waiting for you in this adventure. You might even have to build something sometimes!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just a game for me; it is life itself. All our sorrows, joys, dreams\u2026 In short, all the emotions we experience are brought to life within this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I am Deniz Yukar\u0131\u00e7ukur, the creator of this game. I am also a father\u2014the father of a 3-year-old daughter\u2014and I am married. I tried to reflect everything I\u2019ve felt in real life into this game as much as I could.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, I also included things we\u2019ve always wondered about but never had the chance to experience in real life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I hope you enjoy this game. I\u2019d be very happy if you add it to your wishlist to help this small but sincere community grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/9c5cc65d73b76eeda1a468f1a07aac2a.avif?t=1755646485\" width=616 height=212 /></span></p>","developers":["DNZY Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/76a43cb421a04b4af7f07b0ffe9ae6d0835d3991/header.jpg?t=1755646485","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/st